                "text": "You will only use the Services for your own internal, personal, non-commercial use, and not on behalf of or for the benefit of any third party",
                "source": "https://www.kaggle.com/terms"
            },
            "headline": "Batch only: a submitted kernel takes minutes per call and returns files, never a live response; a second account is a Terms \u00a73 ban, and Kaggle's own docs disagree on whether an idle session dies at 20 or 60 minutes.",
